{
    "title": "JobStack for Work | Job Search",
    "description": "<b>Find flexible jobs with JobStack for Work.</b>\r\n \r\nStart your job search and find flexible local work with PeopleReady\u2019s job finder app, JobStack for Work! Take control of your job search and work when you want, where you want and as often as you want. Our job finder can help you find a job or gig that fits your schedule and your skills. JobStack for Work has flexible job opportunities with thousands of local businesses across the United States. Start your job search now!\r\n \r\nHere\u2019s what you can expect when using JobStack to find a job:\r\n \r\n<b>Easy sign-up:</b>\r\n \r\nOpen the app, create an account and start your job search.\r\n \r\n<b>Showcase your skills:</b>\r\n \r\nSet your job preferences, add your skills and set a radius of where you want to work. \r\n \r\n<b>Choose jobs that work for you:</b>\r\n \r\nWe partner with local businesses looking for people like you! Whether you\u2019re interested in short term gig work or a more permanent position - JobStack has you covered! All you need to do is start your job search. \r\n \r\n<b>Flexible jobs, quick pay</b>\r\n \r\nUsing JobStack has its benefits. Find a job that works with your schedule and get paid quickly. Many of our positions are eligible for next day pay.\r\n \r\n<b>Access more relevant jobs every day</b>\r\n \r\nWhether you\u2019re looking to supplement your income, expand your skillset or just want a flexible work schedule, JobStack for Work has you covered. JobStack helps workers connect with flexible, in-demand gig & temp jobs daily direct from your mobile device. Download JobStack today to find a job, fast. JobStack has a variety of roles within our job finder, from construction, events & venues, janitorial & cleaning, disaster & restoration, hospitality \u2013 and so much more!\r\n \r\n<b>Check out reviews from our workers:</b>\r\n \r\n\u2b50 \u201cLove it! Easy to use! I always find work! Best job search app ever!\"\r\n \r\n\u2b50 \u201cVery professional and easy to use/get started. I'm thankful JobStack and PeopleReady are here to help me find work while I'm in town.\"\r\n \r\n\u2b50\u201cThe new app is great! PeopleReady staff are highly professional.\"\r\n \r\nUse our job finder, sign-up now and start accepting jobs in JobStack for Work!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Find flexible jobs with JobStack for Work.</b><br> <br>Start your job search and find flexible local work with PeopleReady\u2019s job finder app, JobStack for Work! Take control of your job search and work when you want, where you want and as often as you want. Our job finder can help you find a job or gig that fits your schedule and your skills. JobStack for Work has flexible job opportunities with thousands of local businesses across the United States. Start your job search now!<br> <br>Here\u2019s what you can expect when using JobStack to find a job:<br> <br><b>Easy sign-up:</b><br> <br>Open the app, create an account and start your job search.<br> <br><b>Showcase your skills:</b><br> <br>Set your job preferences, add your skills and set a radius of where you want to work. <br> <br><b>Choose jobs that work for you:</b><br> <br>We partner with local businesses looking for people like you! Whether you\u2019re interested in short term gig work or a more permanent position - JobStack has you covered! All you need to do is start your job search. <br> <br><b>Flexible jobs, quick pay</b><br> <br>Using JobStack has its benefits. Find a job that works with your schedule and get paid quickly. Many of our positions are eligible for next day pay.<br> <br><b>Access more relevant jobs every day</b><br> <br>Whether you\u2019re looking to supplement your income, expand your skillset or just want a flexible work schedule, JobStack for Work has you covered. JobStack helps workers connect with flexible, in-demand gig &amp; temp jobs daily direct from your mobile device. Download JobStack today to find a job, fast. JobStack has a variety of roles within our job finder, from construction, events &amp; venues, janitorial &amp; cleaning, disaster &amp; restoration, hospitality \u2013 and so much more!<br> <br><b>Check out reviews from our workers:</b><br> <br>\u2b50 \u201cLove it! Easy to use! I always find work! Best job search app ever!&quot;<br> <br>\u2b50 \u201cVery professional and easy to use/get started. I&#39;m thankful JobStack and PeopleReady are here to help me find work while I&#39;m in town.&quot;<br> <br>\u2b50\u201cThe new app is great! PeopleReady staff are highly professional.&quot;<br> <br>Use our job finder, sign-up now and start accepting jobs in JobStack for Work!",
